[node name="Mail" type="Node" parent="." unique_id=841715243]
unique_name_in_owner = true
script = ExtResource("6_nypig")
mail = "=A Friendly Introduction

Well... what do we have here? Yet another curious soul poking around amidst all this death and decay.

We both know the fate of this doomed mining station. The line between life and death is never thinner than in the cold vacuum of space. Yet, if you are like me, you came itching to know not how, but [u]why[/u].

I sat where you sit, once, eager to unravel this mystery. I had some help, so I'll pay it forward, but not without a little challenge. If you can tell me the man's name- his true name- you will have my aid.

By way of a friendly introduction, why don't you take a look at the morning of Christmas Eve, 1642. They seemed to always serve breakfast at 6am on special holidays.

Looking forward to seeing your progress. And, until then, good luck.

Sincerely yours,
A
=A Job Well Done

Very nice work. Alas, this is where the mystery ends... for now.

With admiration,
A

<Thank you for playing!>
"

